1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,385
The area so far is five halves t squared.

2
00:00:03,385 --> 00:00:07,669
And differentiate that: five t, the speed.

3
00:00:07,669 --> 00:00:11,861
So the area function is the thing whose derivative is the speed.

4
00:00:11,861 --> 00:00:18,515
Finding it means running differentiation backwards: anti-differentiation, or integration.

